__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Piper voices. A model is ~60MB and a personal choice; the repo tells
# you how to get one (JETSON_SETUP.md section 6) rather than shipping it.
# ACTIVE is which one you picked -- also yours, not the project's.
voices/

# deckapps writes these beside itself when it runs
.wiki-app
.face-app

# yuzu_cutout.py's output. DERIVED -- the originals are in ui/art_in/
# and the tool is in the repo, so `python3 yuzu_cutout.py` rebuilds all
# of it. 4.8MB of regenerable PNG is 4.8MB Ghost pulls over WiFi onto a
# board whose clock breaks TLS on a cold boot; the cuts that are
# actually USED get copied into a character's folder and committed
# there. Same call as the V-Pet background being downscaled.
ui/art_out/

# The cube's WiFi, written by ~/YUZU/cube for one flash. It builds in a
# temporary folder and never writes this here -- this line is the belt
# to that braces, in case anyone builds the sketch in place by hand.
stackchan/four_cube/cube_secrets.h
